For everyone that may run into this problem in the future, I did not size the vector for SLR correctly. R automatically sizes them; however, the backend C++ appears not to and that is documented here: https://r-nimble.org/html_manual/cha-RCfunctions.html.  Changing the vector to the output length needed fixed the problem.

