From uc4f557fbb8021162 at groups.google.com  Fri Nov 24 09:46:58 2023
From: uc4f557fbb8021162 at groups.google.com (Chloe Nater)
Date: Fri, 24 Nov 2023 09:46:58 +0000
Subject: Re: Derive 2D parameter from 3D array
Message-ID: <OBgAx4dw4Tk.lxeHJVjWAAAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <OBgAx4dw4Tk.dok8DDsDAAAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
